# Automated Cinematography Analyzer - ignore rules
#
# Rationale: source media, derived frames, model weights, generated reports,
# local databases, secrets, caches, and profiler output are all reproducible or
# sensitive. None of them belong in version control. See docs/product-contract.md
# for the input contract and docs/adr/ADR-0008-release-model-and-license.md for
# the release posture that makes committed media a licensing hazard.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source and intermediate media
# Video and audio containers are never committed, at any path.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.avi
*.wmv
*.flv
*.mpg
*.mpeg
*.m2ts
*.mts
*.mxf
*.ogv
*.3gp
# .ts here means MPEG transport stream. This repository has no TypeScript.
*.ts
*.wav
*.aiff
*.aif
*.flac
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.ogg
*.opus

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Media, artifact, and working directories
# Extracted frames, proxies, keyframes, quarantined uploads, and reports.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/
/media/
/uploads/
/quarantine/
/artifacts/
/frames/
/proxies/
/keyframes/
/thumbnails/
/reports/
/storage/
/var/
/tmp/
/.tmp/
/benchmarks/media/
/demo/media/
/fixtures/media/
/tests/fixtures/media/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights and compiled inference artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/models/
/weights/
/checkpoints/
*.pt
